<div id="urduTextPath">حضرت مسلم (ع)/انساں کیلئے موت ہے غم بے وطنی کا</div>
<p>insaa'n ke liye mout hai gham bewatani ka<br />
jaa'n kah hai andoh-o- alam bewatani ka<br />
sadma nahi kuch mout se kam bewatani ka<br />
aafaat hai qayamat hai sitam bewatani ka</p>

<p>kanto'n ke alam syed-e- sajjad se poocho<br />
eezaa-e- safar muslim-e- nashaad se poocho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ki saqt dagha kufiyou'n ne ghar se bula ke<br />
sab phir gaye jin logo'n ke daawe the wafa ke<br />
lakho'n hai adu jaaye'n kidhar jaan bachake<br />
aafat me giraftaar huwe kufe me aake</p>

<p>yawar nahi hamdam nahi ghamqaar nahi hai<br />
narghe me hai aur koi madadgar nahi hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hai sangdil aise wo jafaakar-o- sitamgar<br />
kotho'n se lagane lage mazloom pa pathar<br />
noorani badan hogaya majrooh saraasar<br />
aur saamne se mu pa laga zulm ka qanjar</p>

<p>kyu gir na pada haaye falak phat ke zami'n par<br />
laale lab-e- jaa'n baqsh gire katke zami'n par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>muh karke soo-e- charq kaha shukr khudaya<br />
raahat hai ye bande ne jo kuch zulm uthaya<br />
gham ye hai ke hai door yadullah ka jaaya<br />
shabbir ke haato se kafan ham ne na paya</p>

<p>dunya se sue quld koi dam me safar hai<br />
yaa'n hampe jo kuch bangayi kya unko qabar hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte the muslim ke laeeno'n ne qazaara<br />
ek sange sitam is labe majrooh pa mara<br />
resh aur garebaa'n me lahu bhar gaya saara<br />
jab haal ye pohncha to kaha jang ka yaara</p>

<p>aada se kaha dil me zara reham ko jaa do<br />
ghash aata hai paani mujhe thoda sa pilaado<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kab sunte the bekas ka suqan zulm ke baani<br />
the qatl ki tadbeer me wo dushmane jaani<br />
le aayi zaeefa wahi'n ek jaam me paani<br />
qismat ne magar bujhne na di tashna dahani</p>

<p>sookhi hui thi gul si zabaa'n qushk gulu tha<br />
us paani ko mu se jo lagaya to lahu tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phainka use jab qaak pa baa deeda e giryaa'n<br />
ek jaam zaeefa ne diya phir unhe us aa'n<br />
peene bhi na paya tha koi ghoont wo zishaa'n<br />
paani me juda hoke gire gouhar-e- dandaa'n</p>

<p>farmaya ke saabit hua pyase hi marenge<br />
ab saaqiye kousar hame sairaab karenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dushman to kayi sau(100) the ye be yaar-o- madadgar<br />
barchi kabhi padhti thi kabhi padhti thi talwar<br />
andoh pe andoh the aazaar pa aazaar<br />
kis yaas se ek ek ka mu takte the har baar</p>

<p>baazu ko sitamgaar jo baandhe the rasan se<br />
fawwara-e- khoo'n chut-ta tha har zaqme badan se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>al-qissa labe baam jo laaya unhe saffaak<br />
tar aansuo'n se hogaya muslim ka ruq-e- paak<br />
faryaad sue kaaba ye ki baadil-e- ghamnaak<br />
roohi ba fidaak aye pisare syed-e- loulaak</p>

<p>karta hai safar qalq se ghamqaar tumhara<br />
mouqoof hai ab hashr pa deedar tumhara<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaake ye gardan tarafe qibla jhukaayi<br />
shamsheer jafaakaar ne chamka ke uthaayi<br />
aawaaz ye maqdooma-e- kounain ki aayi<br />
marta hai har awwal mere bacche ka dohaayi</p>

<p>is zulm se baaz aa jo quda ka tujhe dar hai<br />
zaalim sar-e- muslim pa mera haath sipar hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mere liye kam hashr ke din se ye nahi din<br />
turbat se mai nikli hu liye laasha -e- mohsin<br />
mazloom ko to qatl tu karta hai wo lekin<br />
bin baap ke hojaayenge bacche kayi kamsin</p>

<p>qoo'n sar pe na le chod'de aawara watan ko<br />
kar bewa na abbas-e- dilawar ki bahan ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zehra ne kayi baar tadap kar ye pukara<br />
kya dil tha ke mutlaq na dara wo sitam aara<br />
zalim ne kayi zarb me sar tan se utaara<br />
phat-ta hai jigar ab nahi goyaayi ka yaara</p>

<p>likha hai chala leke jo qaatil sar-e- muslim<br />
kothe ke tale phaink diya paikar-e- muslim<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>